@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #374151
  ArrowThickness 1
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantFontColor #111827

  ActorBorderColor #475569
  ActorBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ActorFontColor #111827

  BoxBorderColor #CBD5E1
  BoxFontColor #111827
  BoxFontStyle bold

  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
  GroupBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  GroupFontColor #111827
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #111827
}

title Executor Runtime Service - Planned Runtime Overview
autonumber

box "Upstream" #F8FAFC
actor "Business Agent" as BusinessAgent
end box

box "Messaging" #F8FAFC
queue "SAP Event Mesh Request Topic" as EventMeshRequestTopic
queue "Technical Agent Request Topic" as TechnicalAgentRequestTopic
queue "Technical Agent Result Topic" as TechnicalAgentResultTopic
queue "SAP Event Mesh Status Topic" as EventMeshStatusTopic
queue "DLQ" as DeadLetterQueue
end box

box "Executor Runtime Service" #EFF6FF
participant "Executor Runtime\nConsumer" as ExecutorConsumer
participant "Step Batch\nValidator" as StepBatchValidator
participant "Dispatch Step\nUse Case" as DispatchStepUseCase
participant "Outbox Relay" as OutboxRelay
participant "Retry Scheduler" as RetryScheduler
end box

box "Persistence / Recovery" #F8FAFC
database "Inbox Store" as InboxStore
database "Execution Store" as ExecutionStore
database "Correlation Store" as CorrelationStore
database "Outbox Repository" as OutboxRepository
database "HANA DB" as HanaDb
end box

box "Execution Targets" #F8FAFC
participant "Technical Agent" as TechnicalAgent
end box

box "Downstream" #F8FAFC
actor "Business Agent /\nOrchestrator" as StatusConsumer
end box

note over ExecutorConsumer,HanaDb #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
This diagram shows planned behavior only.
All dashed arrows represent target-state behavior, not current implementation.
end note

BusinessAgent --> EventMeshRequestTopic: Publish agent.request.executor
EventMeshRequestTopic --> ExecutorConsumer: Deliver raw envelope

group Durable ingest and dedupe
ExecutorConsumer --> InboxStore: Persist inbound envelope + idempotency keys
InboxStore --> HanaDb: Store inbox row
ExecutorConsumer --> ExecutionStore: Create batch/step execution records
ExecutionStore --> HanaDb: Store RECEIVED or READY state
alt Duplicate inbound request
ExecutionStore --> ExecutorConsumer: Existing execution found
ExecutorConsumer --> OutboxRepository: Reuse stored terminal status or skip duplicate
else New inbound request
ExecutorConsumer --> StepBatchValidator: Validate persisted request
alt Poison message or malformed payload
ExecutorConsumer --> DeadLetterQueue: Reject to DLQ
note over DeadLetterQueue #FEE2E2
TARGET FAILURE:
Poison message or malformed payload is routed to DLQ.
end note
else Validation failure
ExecutorConsumer --> OutboxRepository: Write validation-failure executor.step.status
note over OutboxRepository #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
Durable outbox persistence for validation-failure status.
end note
else Valid batch
StepBatchValidator --> ExecutorConsumer: Validated StepBatchRequest
ExecutorConsumer --> ExecutionStore: Mark step states READY
end
end
end

group Outbox-backed publishing
ExecutorConsumer --> OutboxRepository: Write pending status/delegation events
OutboxRepository --> HanaDb: Commit outbox rows with execution state
OutboxRelay --> OutboxRepository: Poll unpublished rows
alt Status event row
OutboxRelay --> EventMeshStatusTopic: Publish executor.step.status
EventMeshStatusTopic --> StatusConsumer: Deliver status event
note over OutboxRelay #DCFCE7
TARGET SUCCESS:
Status can be recovered and replayed after crash.
end note
else Delegated request row
OutboxRelay --> TechnicalAgentRequestTopic: Publish executor.request.agent
end
note over OutboxRelay #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
Use a durable outbox so broker outages do not lose
status updates or delegated requests.
end note
end

group Parallel scheduling and dispatch
RetryScheduler --> ExecutionStore: Claim READY or RETRYING steps
note over RetryScheduler,ExecutionStore #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
Run independent steps in parallel.
Current code still processes steps sequentially in the consumer loop.
end note
par Local tool step
RetryScheduler --> DispatchStepUseCase: Dispatch claimed local step
DispatchStepUseCase --> ExecutionStore: Mark RUNNING_LOCAL_TOOL
DispatchStepUseCase --> OutboxRepository: Queue processing status if required and Technical agent step
RetryScheduler --> DispatchStepUseCase: Dispatch claimed delegated step
DispatchStepUseCase --> ExecutionStore: Mark WAITING_TECHNICAL_AGENT
DispatchStepUseCase --> CorrelationStore: Persist correlation_id -> step_execution_id
CorrelationStore --> HanaDb: Store active waiting correlation
DispatchStepUseCase --> OutboxRepository: Write executor.request.agent row
end
end

group Delegated reply handling and recovery
TechnicalAgent --> TechnicalAgentResultTopic: Publish agent.step.status
TechnicalAgentResultTopic --> ExecutorConsumer: Deliver delegated reply
ExecutorConsumer --> CorrelationStore: Resolve correlation_id
alt First valid terminal reply
CorrelationStore --> ExecutorConsumer: Matching waiting step
ExecutorConsumer --> ExecutionStore: Mark delegated step COMPLETED or FAILED
ExecutorConsumer --> OutboxRepository: Write executor.step.status row
else Late duplicate or orphan reply
CorrelationStore --> ExecutorConsumer: RESOLVED / TIMED_OUT / missing
ExecutorConsumer --> InboxStore: Record response inbox tombstone
note over ExecutorConsumer,CorrelationStore #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
Keep correlation tombstones long enough to suppress
duplicate or late delegated replies after retries or crash recovery.
end note
end

opt Crash recovery / replay
RetryScheduler --> ExecutionStore: Reload RUNNING_LOCAL_TOOL leases, WAITING_TECHNICAL_AGENT, unpublished outbox rows
RetryScheduler --> CorrelationStore: Reload active waiting correlations
RetryScheduler --> OutboxRepository: Republish unpublished rows through Outbox Relay
note over RetryScheduler,OutboxRepository #DCFCE7
TARGET SUCCESS:
Persisted outbox and waiting-state recovery support replay after crash.
end note
end
end

group Retry, timeout, and poison-message controls
alt Local tool or delegated execution times out
RetryScheduler --> ExecutionStore: Mark attempt TIMED_OUT
RetryScheduler --> OutboxRepository: Queue timeout status or retry event
else Transient publish or transport failure
RetryScheduler --> OutboxRepository: Requeue delegated request/status for retry with backoff
else Retry budget exhausted
RetryScheduler --> ExecutionStore: Mark terminal failure
RetryScheduler --> DeadLetterQueue: Route poison or terminal infrastructure failure
note over RetryScheduler,DeadLetterQueue #FEE2E2
TARGET FAILURE:
Repeated publish failure or exhausted retry budget routes work to DLQ.
end note
end
note over RetryScheduler,DeadLetterQueue #FEF3C7
TODO / WARNING:
Add retry backoff, DLQ handling, duplicate protection,
and recovery after crash.
end note
end

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#DCFCE7>| Success / implemented happy path |
  |<#FEF3C7>| TODO / warning / unclear |
  |<#FEE2E2>| Error / failure path |
  |<#EFF6FF>| Executor Runtime Service boundary |
  |<#F8FAFC>| External systems / queues / DB |
endlegend

@enduml
